{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分が理由で、誰かが笑顔になってくれることよりも幸せなことはないです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分が今生きてる世界から遠く離れたところに行きたくて\n少しの自信も特技もなかったけれど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高校3年生の夏に、18年の人生において\n1番とっておきの勇気を使ってみました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobwupRBp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobTYHuNZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何かをとっても頑張ったことがない\nこのために生きたいと思えるものに出会えない\n一生大切にしたいという感情になったことがない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな人にこそ受けてみてほしいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今の自分を空っぽだと思ってしまうときに眩しく見えるものが\n全部ここにあります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切にしたい存在に必ず出会えます˖*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アイドルになりたい理由を上手に説明できなくても"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰の真似でもない自分の言葉で、\n自分が心から思うことを伝えれば、きっと届きます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オーディションには合格・不合格があるから\n不合格は何かが足りないとか、この世界が向いてないとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そういうことだと思ってしまいがちですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分のアイドルになりたい気持ちを再認識したり\n経験した人にしか分からない気持ちを知れたり、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何もしないままの自分でいるより\n必ず得られるものがあります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もし、結果が出ることが怖くて一歩踏み出せないとしたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "受けたけど落ちた、それは無意味なことではないということを\nとてもとても伝えたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が知っている気持ちの全部を説明するには長くなってしまうので、、今日のところは取り急ぎ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "無意味な勇気なんてないということを伝えたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "青葉坂46のオーディション\n応募締め切りは10月8日（木）23:59までです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobaj4RZ4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobkpAyeH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobgkqLPK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "鹿児島でも青葉坂46のお話をさせていただきました〜\nとってもあたたかく迎えてくださって幸せでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46さんの瀬戸口心月ちゃんともお話しできました\nかわいくてかわいくて頭を抱えました🐱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真を撮るタイミングが難しかったので、、\nまたお会いできたときに、、！(*ᴗ͈ ᴗ͈)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも見てました、山本さん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobjVR2PY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16枚目シングルのお話もさせていただいたり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「愛MUST BE」\nhttps://youtu.be/Sp4xl7wtqtc?si=7Eg8OysP1c8_LYe1"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob0Afxk2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob2nAyuq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobSOAtGo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分が渡した愛が理由で、別の誰かにも愛が渡って行く"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分のしたことに意味があったんだなって思えるのは嬉しいことです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobkcpxnJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分へのお返しがなくても"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobmPDsmb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何かをしてあげるときに\n端からお返しなんてなくていいと思える相手"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大切にしたいね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobkzi1zV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobc2Gc27.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVの好きなところとか\nまた、教えてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はやく会いたいよ〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobxbBkc6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob9TxsFR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "16枚目の期間も大切に大切に過ごします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob00gIuO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何度経験したって、お別れが寂しいです\n寂しくて、出会えてよかったなって心から思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーに出会う前まで、\n悲しくないお別れもあったし\nあんまり覚えてない卒業式もあります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobSg5Bee.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobMjxu6z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobub9OxG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今こうして、全部のお別れがきちんと毎回悲しくて\n終わらないでほしいのは、好きだからですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にいられる最後のリハーサルとか\n一緒にいられる最後のステージでの\nメンバーの表情は覚えています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob6wHgy6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後が来ると分かってからもっと\n時間を大事にしようとする自分にため息が出そうになるときもあるけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで近くに居られることは幸せなことです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob9COwcB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mob4ROnzH.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobyLBdz7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二期生が大好きだ〜〜〜〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobo33FEL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん頼ってね\n支え合って素敵なグループでいよう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobrKhfld.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早く着いたらゆっくり一緒にいられるかもね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobTBhjmf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログまったくこまめじゃないですが、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日経エンタテインメント！さんの毎月の連載\n「ミステリアスな向上心」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今思っていることをお話しさせていただいています"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう4年目みたいですびっくり🍩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらを見てくださっているみなさん、\nいつもありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうすぐのお知らせです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月7日19:00〜\nMBC南日本放送「てゲてゲ」出演させていただきます𖤐˒˒\nとーーーっても見ていた番組なので嬉しいです\n鹿児島にお住まいの方はぜひ、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月7日23:59〜24:24\n中京テレビ「SAVE MONEY」出演させていただきます𖤐˒˒\n考えてみたこともない視点のクイズばかりで楽しかったです😸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10月10日18:56〜21:54\nテレビ朝日「池上彰のニュースそうだったのか!!」小田倉麗奈ちゃんと一緒に出演させていただきます𖤐˒˒\n3時間スペシャルです、ぜひ一緒に2択クイズ挑戦してみてください♩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「愛MUST BE」をパフォーマンスさせていただく場もみなさんの楽しみになれるよう、頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202610/mobvpgH69.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きみゃす"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大園玲"}], "source": "official"}